      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَشْفَشَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَشْفَشَةٌ</span>, (Fr, O,)
<i>He was,</i> or <i>became, weak in judgment.</i> (Fr, O,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, extravagant, immoderate,</i> or <i>excessive, in lying:</i> (IDrd, O, K:) or
so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فشفش فِى قَوْلِهِ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فشفش بِبَوْلِهِ</span> <i>He
sprinkled his urine;</i> (IDrd, O, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَفْشَفَ</span>.
(IDrd, O.)

